{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10378","headline":"同韩四薛三东亭翫月 · 高适","name":"同韩四薛三东亭翫月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远游怅不乐，兹赏吾道存。\n款曲故人意，辛勤清夜言。\n东亭何寥寥，佳境无朝昏。\n堦墀近洲渚，户牖当郊原。\n矧乃穷周旋，游时怡讨论。\n树阴荡瑶瑟，月气延清尊。\n明河带飞雁，野火连荒村。\n对此更愁予，悠哉怀故园。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10378.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10378","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}